                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, POL 7 US/VANCE. Secret; Exdis. Received at 0356Z and also sent to
                    Ankara.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d321-f2" n="2" xml:id="d321-f2-content">
                <p>The Embassy reported on this meeting in telegram 2419 from Athens, November 25.
                    (Ibid.)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d321-f3" n="3" xml:id="d321-f3-content">
                <p>The text of the Greek proposal was transmitted in Vanto 17 from Ankara, November 25. (Ibid.)</p>
